    Quadlet vs Old Systemd
        | Feature  | Quadlet                                  | Old podman generate systemd |
        | -------- | ---------------------------------------- | --------------------------- |
        | Location | ~/.config/containers/systemd/*.container | ~/.config/systemd/user/     |
        | Reload   | systemctl --user daemon-reload           | Manual file move            |
        | SELinux  | Native :z volumes                        | Manual tweaks               |
        | Modern   | Podman 4.4+ standard                     | Deprecated warning          |

